{"id":"f233d5485efaad7c","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-bisimulation.md","title":"Bisimulation","display":"df-bisimulation — Bisimulation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-bisimulation","aliases":["89-df-bisimulation","bisimulation","双模拟","互模拟"],"display":"df-bisimulation — Bisimulation","depends_on":["[[89-df-kripke-model]]","[[89-df-kripke-frame]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-bisimulation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-bisimulation</span><span>bisimulation</span><span>双模拟</span><span>互模拟</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-bisimulation — Bisimulation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78d4bf1505bda5c\" href=\"?note=c78d4bf1505bda5c\" title=\"89-df-kripke-frame\">89-df-kripke-frame</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"df-bisimulation-—-Bisimulation-$Z$\">df-bisimulation — Bisimulation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span></h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\">\\(\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}&#39; = (W&#39;, R&#39;, V&#39;)\">\\(\\mathcal{M}&#39; = (W&#39;, R&#39;, V&#39;)\\)</span> (Kripke model, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\">\\(Z\\subseteq W\\times W&#39;\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bisimulation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;\n(w\\in V(p)\\leftrightarrow w&#39;\\in V&#39;(p))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall v\\in W\\;\n(wRv\\to\\exists v&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;(w&#39;R&#39;v&#39;\\land(v,v&#39;)\\in Z))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall v&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;\n(w&#39;R&#39;v&#39;\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land(v,v&#39;)\\in Z))\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bisimulation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M&#39;)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;\n(w\\in V(p)\\leftrightarrow w&#39;\\in V&#39;(p))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall v\\in W\\;\n(wRv\\to\\exists v&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;(w&#39;R&#39;v&#39;\\land(v,v&#39;)\\in Z))\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall(w,w&#39;)\\in Z\\;\\forall v&#39;\\in W&#39;\\;\n(w&#39;R&#39;v&#39;\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land(v,v&#39;)\\in Z))\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Z\">\\(Z\\)</span> : 双模拟关系</li>\n</ul>\n<p>双模拟是模态逻辑中的&quot;结构等价&quot;概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>双模拟的模型满足相同的模态公式</li>\n<li>双模拟保留了模态逻辑能表达的所有信息</li>\n</ul>\n<p>双模拟不变性定理：\n若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}, w\">\\(\\mathcal{M}, w\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}&#39;, w&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{M}&#39;, w&#39;\\)</span> 双模拟，则对任意模态公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\">\\(\\varphi\\)</span>：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\mathcal{M}&#39;, w&#39; \\models \\varphi\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\mathcal{M}&#39;, w&#39; \\models \\varphi\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>双模拟的意义：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>模态逻辑不能区分双模拟的模型</li>\n<li>不同的模型可能对模态逻辑&quot;不可区分&quot;</li>\n<li>双模拟是模态逻辑的&quot;最大表达能力&quot;界限</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ab746eb779e20ce0\" href=\"?note=ab746eb779e20ce0\" title=\"89-df-kripke-model\">89-df-kripke-model</a>：双模拟作用于模型</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"4505fdbef0375a48\" href=\"?note=4505fdbef0375a48\" title=\"89-df-generated-submodel\">89-df-generated-submodel</a>：生成的子模型与原模型双模拟</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c922518c30c4107d\" href=\"?note=c922518c30c4107d\" title=\"89-df-canonical-model\">89-df-canonical-model</a>：逻辑的典范模型</li>\n<li><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a5213da99983a05a\" href=\"?note=a5213da99983a05a\" title=\"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance\">89-lem-bisimulation-invariance</a>：双模拟不变性定理</li>\n</ul>\n<p>参考文献：Boolos, George. <em>The Logic of Provability</em>. Chapter 2.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"df-bisimulation-—-Bisimulation-$Z$","text":"df-bisimulation — Bisimulation $Z$","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c78d4bf1505bda5c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)$ (Kripke model, see [[89-df-kripke-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal{M}' = (W', R', V')$ (Kripke model, see [[89-df-kripke-model]])","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-kripke-model","status":"resolved","id":"ab746eb779e20ce0","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-kripke-model]]：双模拟作用于模型","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-generated-submodel","status":"resolved","id":"4505fdbef0375a48","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-generated-submodel]]：生成的子模型与原模型双模拟","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-canonical-model","status":"resolved","id":"c922518c30c4107d","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-df-canonical-model]]：逻辑的典范模型","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-bisimulation-invariance","status":"resolved","id":"a5213da99983a05a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"[[89-lem-bisimulation-invariance]]：双模拟不变性定理","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M} = (W, R, V)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}' = (W', R', V')","display":false},{"tex":"Z\\subseteq W\\times W'","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}bisimulation}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M,\\mathcal M')\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\left(\n\\begin{aligned}\n&\\forall(w,w')\\in Z\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\;\n(w\\in V(p)\\leftrightarrow w'\\in V'(p))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall(w,w')\\in Z\\;\\forall v\\in W\\;\n(wRv\\to\\exists v'\\in W'\\;(w'R'v'\\land(v,v')\\in Z))\\\\\n&{}\\land\\forall(w,w')\\in Z\\;\\forall v'\\in W'\\;\n(w'R'v'\\to\\exists v\\in W\\;(wRv\\land(v,v')\\in Z))\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"Z","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}, w","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}', w'","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal{M}, w \\models \\varphi \\;\\Leftrightarrow\\; \\mathcal{M}', w' \\models \\varphi","display":true}],"bytes":1902,"backlinks":[{"id":"170626a7dad88370","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]：过滤与双模拟相关"},{"id":"f92b2b6a2706404b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]：p-态射与双模拟相关"},{"id":"774a7723667e1813","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-bisimulation]]：双模拟保持真值集"},{"id":"adf58ca2c7888ac9","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bisim}(Z;\\mathcal M_1,\\mathcal M_2)$ is the predicate from\n[[89-df-bisimulation]]."},{"id":"6983c729bb4a6b9e","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z$ : 互模拟 (see [[89-df-bisimulation]])"},{"id":"c871e3c00e89d8af","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"85a935be75e89f98","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a5213da99983a05a","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$Z$ : 互模拟关系 (see [[89-df-bisimulation]])"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-4-axiom.md]]\n[[89-df-accessibility.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-interpretation.md]]\n[[89-df-arithmetical-realization.md]]\n[[89-df-bisimulation.md]]\n[[89-df-box-modality.md]]\n[[89-df-canonical-model.md]]\n[[89-df-completeness-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consistency-modal.md]]\n[[89-df-consis